1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,210
Listen to a talk on a psychology podcast.

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:02,651
Woman:

3
00:00:02,651 --> 00:00:08,792
The placebo effect occurs when people experience real health improvements after receiving a treatment

4
00:00:08,792 --> 00:00:13,147
with no medical value—like a sugar pill—simply

5
00:00:13,147 --> 00:00:14,090
because they believe it’s real.

6
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:19,939
Clinical trials use various placebos, including creams, gels,

7
00:00:19,939 --> 00:00:22,070
or even fake devices.

8
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:26,791
It’s important that these are designed to closely resemble actual treatments.

9
00:00:26,791 --> 00:00:32,299
This ensures that participants can’t tell whether they’re receiving the real treatment

10
00:00:32,299 --> 00:00:33,479
or the placebo,

11
00:00:33,479 --> 00:00:38,200
which in turn keeps the study fair and the results scientifically reliable.

12
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:42,948
The placebo effect highlights the powerful connection between mind and body.

13
00:00:42,948 --> 00:00:48,992
It’s influenced by factors such as patient expectations, how the treatment is delivered,

14
00:00:48,992 --> 00:00:51,150
and the provider’s credibility.

15
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:56,517
In fact, a recent study found that when people expect relief, their brains respond

16
00:00:56,517 --> 00:00:59,200
as if real medicine has been given.

17
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:06,900
This expectation alone can trigger specific brain activity, activating a pathway that links regions

18
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:10,200
involved in thought, emotion, and movement.

19
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:15,426
When these areas work together, they create a kind of bridge, connecting mind

20
00:01:15,426 --> 00:01:18,240
and body—mental belief and physical response.

21
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:23,836
While placebos don’t actually cure diseases, the belief that a treatment will work can

22
00:01:23,836 --> 00:01:27,200
lead to real improvements in how a patient feels.

23
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:27,722
So,

24
00:01:27,722 --> 00:01:35,030
when combined with actual medicine, I believe this psychological boost can enhance overall care.
